```html
<style>
  .row { display: flex; width: 20rem; }
  .avatar { flex: 0 0 3rem; }
  .message { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
  .message a { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
<div class="row">
  <div class="avatar">Photo</div>
  <p class="message"><a href="#">averylongunbrokenaddress.example/path</a></p>
</div>
```
The message item can now shrink inside the 20rem row, and its link has an explicit wrapping policy.
